@prefix cepio: <https://cepio.org/ontology/core#> .
@prefix ind: <https://cepio.org/ontology/industrial#> .
@prefix energy: <https://cepio.org/ontology/energy#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

energy:UpstreamAsset a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cepio:Asset .
energy:Well a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf energy:UpstreamAsset .
energy:Reservoir a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf energy:UpstreamAsset .
energy:Pipeline a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ind:Equipment .
energy:Refinery a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ind:Facility .
energy:Hydrocracker a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ind:ProcessUnit .
energy:PetrochemicalComplex a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ind:Facility .
